    "model": "Radiated group delay (only with 11 points): H(f) = E_far(theta=0, phi=0, f) exp(+j k r) / a_inc(f), with a_inc the incident-wave voltage at the launch plane (same reference plane as S11), r = 1 m, k = 2 pi f / c0. E_theta and E_phi of the phi=0 cut are the x and y components at broadside (theta_hat = x_hat, phi_hat = y_hat at phi = 0). tau_g = -d arg(H)/d omega from the unwrapped phase with central differences (one-sided at the ends). The excitation spectrum and its phase cancel; the NF2FF phase centre only adds a constant (z of the centre / c0 at broadside). The absolute value contains the constant electrical length of the line and of the stub; only the variation over the band (ripple) is meaningful. DIAGNOSTIC: not validated against a reference; 49.92 MHz spacing is below the DTFT resolution 1/T_record of the run, so adjacent samples are not independent.",
